  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IFC regionalt SME</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional IFC SME Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till IFCs facilitet f&#xF6;r SME i Albanien, Makedonien, BiH, Kosovo (FRJ). 5-&#xE5;rigt program, Sidas finansiering avser de f&#xF6;rsta tre &#xE5;ren. Programmets m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att fr&#xE4;mja utveclingen av det privata f&#xF6;retagandet i regionen genom aktiviteter riktade s&#xE5;v&#xE4;l direkt mot SME som mot det institutionella ramverket inom vilka dessa &#xE4;r verksamma.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the IFC SME Facility for Albania, Macedonia, BiH and Kosovo (FRY). Sida funding is for the first 3 years of the 5-year programme. The objective is to support the development of a sutainableprivate sector in the region through activities directed towards SME as well as the institutional framework.</narrative>
  </description>
